section: js-backend
synopsis: Fix stack corruption in the generic apply with 31 or more argument registers.
  ``h$ap_gen_fast`` wrote registers above R31 to wrong stack slots (off by 4),
  corrupting the stack frame below and reloading stale values for the
  affected arguments. This affected unknown calls to thunks with 31 or more
  argument register slots.
